  "title": "Algorithms for In-Place, Consistent Network Update",
  "abstract": "Network configurations are regularly updated in response to issues such as congestion, failures, network changes, and modifications to security policies. We present a simple distributed algorithm for network update that operates on the fly and in place, and guarantees strong route-consistency. Existing methods are either weakly consistent, or do not operate in place and require excessive memory.",
